    · change 0*(star (g 1 1)/(r:ℂ))+(r:ℂ)*(g 1 0/(r:ℂ))=g 1 0
      field_simp [hrC] ; ring
    · change 0*(-star (g 1 0)/(r:ℂ))+(r:ℂ)*(g 1 1/(r:ℂ))=g 1 1
